WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.390
Tina: A waterslide! They are so much fun.

2
00:00:04.391 --> 00:00:06.521
Brad: You’re both crazy.

3
00:00:06.522 --> 00:00:09.821
You don’t know where it leads.

4
00:00:09.822 --> 00:00:12.027
Danny: It has to lead somewhere.

5
00:00:12.028 --> 00:00:14.214
I think we should try it.

6
00:00:14.216 --> 00:00:16.536
Tina: I’ll go first! Ready?

7
00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:21.935
Start right after me, Brad!

8
00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:23.977
Danny: You better go, Brad.

9
00:00:23.978 --> 00:00:25.990
We don’t want to lose her.

10
00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:35.996
One, two, three! I’m right behind you! Tina:

11
00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:39.372
Wheee! This is incredible! Brad:

12
00:00:39.374 --> 00:00:42.457
I think I’m going to be sick.

13
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:46.722
Danny: This is more fun than being in class!

14
00:00:46.723 --> 00:00:49.129
Brad: Whoo-hoo!

15
00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:54.659
Danny: That’s the spirit, Brad.

16
00:00:54.660 --> 00:01:00.051
Tina: It’s about time we had fun!

17
00:01:00.052 --> 00:01:02.417
Danny: Which way do we go?

18
00:01:02.418 --> 00:01:04.076
Tina: I don’t know!

19
00:01:04.077 --> 00:01:06.613
Brad, what do you think?

20
00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:08.883
Brad: How should I know?!

21
00:01:08.884 --> 00:01:13.207
Danny: Somebody decide quickly!

22
00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:16.727
Tina: This way!

23
00:01:16.728 --> 00:01:19.404
Brad: What if we went the wrong way?

24
00:01:19.405 --> 00:01:22.832
Tina: Then this won’t be much fun anymore.

25
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:26.935
Danny: We haven’t done too badly, so far.

26
00:01:26.936 --> 00:01:33.511
Brad: Oh yeah? Well, just look ahead.

27
00:01:33.512 --> 00:01:35.667
Al threel: Aaah!

28
00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:38.129
Tina: Danny . . . this isn’t good.

29
00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:43.443
Brad: Yeah. Now would be a good time to use your imagination again.

30
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:45.907
Danny: I’ve got an idea!

31
00:01:45.908 --> 00:01:48.014
Hold on to me!

32
00:01:48.015 --> 00:01:49.497
Brad: What?

33
00:01:49.498 --> 00:01:52.657
Danny: You and Tina. Hold on to me!

34
00:01:52.658 --> 00:01:55.875
Tina: This better work!

35
00:01:55.876 --> 00:01:57.629
Brad: Oh no!

36
00:01:57.631 --> 00:02:02.145
Tina: Danny, do something!

37
00:02:02.146 --> 00:02:10.221
Danny: Both of you, start

38
00:02:10.222 --> 00:02:12.878
blowing. Tina: You’re a genius,

39
00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.753
Danny! Brad: Hey, I’m the smart

40
00:02:15.754 --> 00:02:25.306
one. Danny: More blowing, less

41
00:02:25.307 --> 00:02:31.134
talking! That’s it, I think we’ve stopped falling.

42
00:02:31.135 --> 00:02:37.694
Brad: I . . . can’t . . . blow . . . anymore!

43
00:02:37.695 --> 00:02:44.417
Tina: I’m . . . out of . . . breath . . . too!

44
00:02:44.418 --> 00:02:48.044
Danny: Don’t stop now, you guys!

45
00:02:48.045 --> 00:02:50.679
Tina: Everybody blow!

46
00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.815
Danny: Hurry!

47
00:02:54.816 --> 00:03:00.353
Brad: Oh no!

